      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "side b",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>Similarly, this X, daughter of master</li>\n<li>X, accepted and undertook</li>\n<li>to esteem, honor,</li>\n<li>attend and serve her husband</li>\n<li>in purity, in the manner of respectable women,&nbsp;</li>\n<li>the daughters of Israel, who esteem,</li>\n<li>honor, attend and serve</li>\n<li>their husbands in purity and cleanness. And she consented</li>\n<li>to become his wife and the mother</li>\n<li>of children, according to the law of Moses and the Jews.</li>\n<li>This master, X b. X, betrothed (qiddesh)</li>\n<li>this lady X</li>\n<li>daughter of X, with the mohar fixed by</li>\n<li>our masters the sages&mdash;for a virgin two hundred</li>\n<li>and for a widow a mane (100)&mdash;and with a mohar of so much,</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
